{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49394","headline":"甘州遍 一 · 毛文锡","name":"甘州遍 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春光好，公子爱闲游，足风流。\n金鞍白马，雕弓宝劒，红缨锦襜出长楸。\n花蔽膝，玉衔头。\n寻芳逐胜欢宴，丝竹不曾休。\n美人唱，揭调是甘州。\n醉红楼，尧年舜日，乐圣永无忧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"毛文锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49394.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49394","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}